      "writtenOn": "2024-07-25T16:03:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You might need to set the console device of the vm, for example https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/bcf84dd125b52c07fa6ea7adee2e1b0f26a0b35b/ferrochrome_app/vm_config.json.template#40\n\n\nThe vm should start a Getty service listening on the same device.\nBy default it is hvc0, it also supports being set to ttyS0.\nIf you need other device ports, we can just add them.",
